  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Survey on Drug use in Afghanistan (NSDA) Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to: (i) determine drug use in the general population; (ii) estimate the socio-demographic characteristics of current drug users; (iii) generate information on the age, frequency and pattern of current drug use; (iv) enhance understanding around the levels of drug-related health and social consequences.</narrative>
  </description>
